## Repository Architecture & Navigation

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    classDef primary fill:#1f2937,stroke:#4f46e5,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef execution fill:#0f172a,stroke:#0ea5e9,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#fff
    classDef strategy fill:#111827,stroke:#10b981,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#fff
    classDef tools fill:#1e1b4b,stroke:#8b5cf6,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#fff

    Root["📁 bd-leadership Repository"] :::primary

    %% Strategy & Operations Branch
    Root --> Ops["01-operating-model<br/>• Charter & Definitions<br/>• Handoff Standard<br/>• Rules of Engagement"] :::strategy
    Root --> ICP["02-icp-and-account-scoring<br/>• ICP & Personas<br/>• score_accounts.py<br/>• backtest.py"] :::strategy
    Root --> Signals["03-signals-and-research<br/>• Signal Library<br/>• Research Standard"] :::strategy
    Root --> Metrics["07-metrics-and-forecasting<br/>• Funnel Diagnostics<br/>• unit-economics.md"] :::strategy

    %% Execution & Execution Support Branch
    Root --> Campaigns["04-outbound-campaigns<br/>• Cadences & Copy<br/>• Objection Handling<br/>• competitive-displacement.md"] :::execution
    Root --> AIWorkflows["08-ai-workflows<br/>• pipeline.py (End-to-End Agent)<br/>• account_brief.py<br/>• Prompts (Brief, First Line, Call)"] :::execution
    Root --> Stack["12-stack-configuration<br/>• Salesforce Field Specs<br/>• Outreach Sequences<br/>• Orum Call Blocks"] :::execution
    Root --> Compliance["13-compliance<br/>• CASL / GDPR / PECR / CAN-SPAM"] :::execution

    %% Team & Enablement Branch
    Root --> Coaching["05-coaching<br/>• 1:1 Templates & Game Film<br/>• Call/Email Scorecards"] :::tools
    Root --> Hiring["06-hiring-and-onboarding<br/>• Interview Loops<br/>• retention-and-team-health.md"] :::tools
    Root --> Coverage["14-global-coverage<br/>• Time-Zone Models"] :::tools
    Root --> Dogfooding["15-content-library-for-bdrs<br/>• Governed QA Library"] :::tools

    %% Proof & Interactive Tools
    Root --> CaseStudies["case-studies/<br/>• Planful & Certa Proof Layer"] :::primary
    Root --> Interactive["docs/capacity-calculator.html<br/>• Live Funnel & Headcount App"] :::primary

    %% Pipeline Execution Connections
    ICP -- "Scores Data" --> AIWorkflows
    Signals -- "Feeds Hooks" --> AIWorkflows
    AIWorkflows -- "Enrolls Prospects" --> Stack
    Stack -- "Enforces Standards" --> Ops
    Metrics -- "Calibrates Weights" --> ICP
```

---

## Quick Start Commands

```bash
# 1. Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# 2. Score target accounts using fit & signal weights
python 02-icp-and-account-scoring/score_accounts.py sample-data/accounts.csv

# 3. Validate conversion lift against historical datasets
python 02-icp-and-account-scoring/backtest.py sample-data/historical.csv

# 4. Generate AI account brief & personalized hooks (dry-run mode)
python 08-ai-workflows/pipeline.py build sample-data/accounts.csv sample-data/contacts.csv

# 5. Process human-approved briefs into sequence execution payloads
python 08-ai-workflows/pipeline.py enroll approval_queue.csv
```
